sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant Client
    participant Route
    participant Auth_Middleware
    participant Controller
    participant Service
    participant Database

    Client->>+Route: POST /:otherUserId
    Route->>+Auth_Middleware: Validate
    Note over Auth_Middleware: 🔐 Authentication&#58; JWT token verify করা হচ্ছে
    Note over Auth_Middleware: Roles&#58; USER_ROLES.TASKER, USER_ROLES.POSTER
    Auth_Middleware->>-Route: Valid ✓
    Route->>+Controller: ChatController.createChat
    Controller->>+Service: ChatService.createChatToDB()
    Service->>+Database: Chat.findOne({
    participants: { $all: payload },
  })
    Note over Database: 💾 Database Query&#58; MongoDB থেকে data fetch করা হচ্ছে
    Database->>-Service: result
    Service->>+Database: Chat.create({ participants: payload })
    Note over Database: 💾 Database Query&#58; MongoDB থেকে data fetch করা হচ্ছে
    Database->>-Service: result
    Service->>-Controller: result
    Controller->>-Route: StatusCodes.CREATED - Create Chat Successfully
    Route-->>Client: Response
    Note over Client: ✅ Create Chat Successfully
